Package: nlmixr2nn
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Title: Neural-Network ODEs for 'rxode2' and 'nlmixr2'
Description: Embed neural networks inside ordinary differential equation
    right-hand sides for 'rxode2' and 'nlmixr2'. Networks are exposed as
    compiled 'rxode2' custom functions that supply the network value and
    its analytic input derivatives, allowing larger networks than the
    per-weight code-generation approach of 'pmxNODE'.
Authors@R: person("Matthew", "Fidler", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "matthew.fidler@gmail.com")
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://nlmixr2.github.io/nlmixr2nn/, https://github.com/nlmixr2/nlmixr2nn
BugReports: https://github.com/nlmixr2/nlmixr2nn/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: rxode2, checkmate, stats, symengine, torch
LinkingTo: rxode2, Rcpp, nlmixr2est
SystemRequirements: libtorch (via the 'torch' R package; C++17). Both the
    'torch' package and its libtorch binaries (torch::install_torch()) must be
    present to build, and libtorch is loaded at run time.
Suggests: nlmixr2, nlmixr2est, numDeriv, testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr, rmarkdown, minqa, lbfgsb3c, n1qn1, ggplot2, callr, withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
NeedsCompilation: yes
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
